"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9027b029-e2b4-4f14-9ab3-645b5bc97cc8\" />\n**Rects Draw calls = 20**\n<img width=\"1920\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bfa48081-e42c-4fc1-82f1-f7a490d243c9\" />\n**Circle_Filled Draw calls = 10**\n<img width=\"1920\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a07579e-71d5-4a03-861f-e74e6792f0da\" />\n **### Circle_Not_Filled Draw calls = 10**\n<img width=\"1920\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f99553ee-a6fa-4250-9fa8-b9aadce3d0de\" />\n**Circles Draw calls = 20**\n<img width=\"1920\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df480816-9770-4f4f-9594-a344c28230a9\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAll is in the minimal project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[_draw_test_for_draw_calls.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20554783/_draw_test_for_draw_calls.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107042/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107042/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}